<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Sangyo to issue warrant bonds.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Sangyo to issue warrant bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Tokyo Sangyo Co Ltd</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Nikko Securities</p>
<p> TYPE domestic warrant  ISSUE NO  1	   AMT   200 million yen</p>
<p> COUPON  0.4 pct	  ISS PRICE 100 yen   MATURITY 27.Mar.00</p>
<p> EXERCISE FRM 1.May.97  EXERCISE TO 24.Mar.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	     PAY DATE 27.Mar.97  INT PAY 27.Mar/Sept</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		   SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 11-26 Mar</p>
<p> LAST JCR		   LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
